          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Which of the following are mathematical statements?\n\n- $P: \\{5,6,7\\}\\cap \\{6,8,10\\} = \\{6\\}$\n\n- $Q: \\sqrt{3} +2$\n\n- $R: 4\\mid 2$\n\n**Note**: The notation \n\n$$\na\\mid b\n$$\n\nmeans \"$a$ divides $b.$\" This is equivalent to the statement that $b$ is divisible by $a.$",
